  <entry>
    <title>谷歌账号使用澳门手机号通过验证方法</title>
    <link href="https://www.leguanderen.com/article/gu-ge-zhang-hao-shi-yong-ao-men-shou-ji-hao-tong-guo-yan-zheng-fang-fa.html"/>
    <id>https://www.leguanderen.com/article/gu-ge-zhang-hao-shi-yong-ao-men-shou-ji-hao-tong-guo-yan-zheng-fang-fa.html</id>
    <published>2025-10-09T12:57:52.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-10-09T12:59:48.105Z</updated>
    
    
    <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;我曾经注册过很多个谷歌账号，但无一例外的都被封禁。起初我以为可能是IP的问题，IP可能不干净。于是我换了几个其他IP，可最后都是会跳到验证手机号这一步然后提示此手机号无法进行验证。&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
    
    
    
    
